  "description": "Adds a bottom-anchored staged-progress overlay to G9MAUIControls: one Running / Canceling / Success / Error state machine plus a draggable minimized bubble, a 44dp cancel target that never routes a cancellation through an error terminal, and a retry affordance on failure. Mounts above the toast stack via the core's IG9BottomAnchoredOverlay seam. No dependencies beyond the core.",
